WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:04.171 line:0%
<i>Nothing is more glamorous
than walking the red carpet.</i>

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.589 line:0%
<i>Unless you're me!</i>

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.591 line:0%
Bing!

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:12.137 line:0%
<i>My name is Jason Bolden,
Creative Director for JSN Studio,</i>

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.972 line:0%
<i>where we do interior design
and celebrity styling.</i>

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.684 position:59% line:0%
I'm Adair Curtis, Jason's better half.

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:19.686 line:0%
<i>I oversee the interior design,</i>

00:00:19.812 --> 00:00:22.564 position:58% line:0%
and while Jason is running his mouth,
I'm running our business.

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:25.359 position:58% line:0%
Where do you come up with this stuff?

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:27.653 position:58% line:0%
<i>Our clients are real life superstars.</i>

00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:29.738 position:59% line:0%
Why am I getting actual chills though?

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:31.490 line:0%
This is your kitchen.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.784 line:0%
-Wow!
-This is crazy, man.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.785 line:0%
Oh, my God!

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.702 line:0%
Amazing!

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.498 position:56% line:0%
Women that we work with
are the epitome of black girl magic.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.124 line:0%
<i>But it's definitely not easy.</i>

00:00:42.457 --> 00:00:43.543 line:0%
<i>It's the day before the Emmys.</i>

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:45.295 line:0%
It's a hole in the dress.

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:47.673 position:58% line:0%
You are no longer part of JSN Studio.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:49.132 line:0%
We are done.

00:00:50.297 --> 00:00:51.969 line:0%
<i>We've never really heard about</i>

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.344 line:0%
<i>black interior decorators
and celebrity stylists.</i>

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:56.932 line:0%
<i>The demand is really high for us.</i>

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.603 line:0%
You married a superstar.

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.813 line:0%
I did.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.648 line:0%
You're my Ivanka.

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.734 line:0%
Well, we getting a divorce.

